# Local dev only: PostgreSQL + Mailpit, profile dev, JWT/OTP keys in environment.
# Replace email/password for your own local test; never commit a real token/password.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8085
@email = hoang.demo@example.com
@password = DemoPassword123!
@otp = PASTE_SIX_DIGIT_CODE_FROM_MAILPIT
@token = PASTE_LOGIN_TOKEN_LOCALLY

### 1. Register (201). Read the OTP at http://localhost:8025.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn Huy Hoàng",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "phone": "0901234567"
}

### 2. Verify email (204). Keep the code a string to preserve leading zeros.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "code": "{{otp}}"
}

### 3. Login (200). Copy token from response to your local client variable.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 4. Current account (200).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Optional: resend (202), only after at least 60 seconds and while unverified.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Missing JWT (401 JSON).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
